00:07:11.773 --> 00:07:26.818
Yeah, that's fantastic So meals I know as I was only there in the later season to sort of put together what we were talking about in the main episode of this episode talking about this episode of the technology sure and Josh your comfort level.
是的，那太棒了所以我知道饭菜，因为我只是在后一季才在那里整理我们在本集主要情节中谈论的内容，谈论这一集的技术当然和乔什你的舒适度。

00:07:26.818 --> 00:07:37.485
I just remember closing in the seasons eight and nine, the delta, the time between cut and the cell phone coming out to make a call to Scott shorter and shorter and shorter.
我只记得第八季和第九季结束时，三角洲、剪辑和拿出手机给斯科特打电话之间的时间越来越短。

00:07:37.485 --> 00:07:39.088
Where was that cell phone?
那部手机在哪里？

00:07:39.088 --> 00:07:41.740
How would you already have it in your hand?
你怎么会已经把它拿在手里了呢？

00:07:41.740 --> 00:07:45.143
Pam is very, very, Pam is the loveliest director of the loveliest human.
帕姆非常非常，帕姆是最可爱的人类的最可爱的导演。

00:07:45.143 --> 00:07:47.932
She's the kindest person she never got mad at anybody once.
她是一个最善良的人，从来没有生过任何人的气。

00:07:47.932 --> 00:07:53.794
I never saw her as her voice, but she would have been knowing and have these little passive aggressive things she would say.
我从未将她视为她的声音，但她会知道并且会说一些被动的攻击性的事情。

00:07:53.794 --> 00:07:55.827
And she was always in the right, of course.
当然，她总是对的。

00:07:55.827 --> 00:07:57.056
I don't mean in a bad way.
我并不是说不好的意思。

00:07:57.056 --> 00:08:04.336
But I remember she would, if she would see you guys or any of the actor, any of the cast, go right to their phone and then be on the phone the whole time.
但我记得，如果她看到你们或任何演员、任何演员，她会直接拿起电话，然后一直打电话。

00:08:04.336 --> 00:08:06.605
And we're coming up on her calling action again.
我们将再次关注她的呼吁行动。

00:08:06.605 --> 00:08:10.339
She would, while she would look over and she would just say, an actor prepares.
她会，当她看过去时，她只会说，演员正在准备。

00:08:10.339 --> 00:08:13.390
You know, I did, it was devastating.
你知道，我做到了，那是毁灭性的。

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:18.220
It's all she had to say through words and actor prepares.
这就是她必须通过言语和演员准备说的话。

